# Turtles in Time: "Return all creatures to their owners' hands. Each player may shuffle their hand and graveyard into their
# library, then each player who does draws seven cards. Exile Turtles in Time." Both players say yes: each creature is in its
# owner's hand when the hands are shuffled in (CR 400.7), every graveyard goes too, and each draws a new seven. The spell is
# exiled, not shuffled in.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Turtles in Time
Island x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Forest x30

